- `GET /p/conversions/s/0.8.54` — Get conversion data by version.
- `GET /p/conversions/t/{tId}` — Get conversion data by ID.

### Data Write (2)
- `POST /actionp/0` — Report an action event.
- `POST /p/conversions/c/z` — Report a conversion event.

